	(text "Shunt calibration switch (TS5A3166, one per channel)\nMCU drives SHUNT_CALx high -> switch closes -> 174k is placed across the bridge arm (SIG+ to GNDA).\nThis simulates a known strain: 350 / (2.0 x (350 + 174k)) = ~1000 µε (GF = 2.0).\nR73 (100k) holds the switch OFF at power-up / reset.\n\nTo calibrate: \n1) switch OFF, record zero reading\n2) SHUNT_CALx HIGH, record new reading\n3) µε per count = 1000 / (reading_on - reading_off)\n4) switch OFF and resume normal measurements"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.936 87.122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ab58db6e-c8e9-45be-a9a2-bc94e617e77a")
	)
	(text "Half: J15 replaces R92, J16 replaces R94\nFit R93, R95 (R92, R94 DNP)"
